WEBVTT

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:44.900
So, I'm counting on you.

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:47.590
Yes, I'm leaving now.

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:11.020
Ten days have passed already since Eigetsu arrived in Sekiei Village.

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:14.780
Now, the infusion is ready.

00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:17.750
Please make everyone drink this.

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:21.250
For people with severe inflammation, add extra skin of Betel palm.

00:02:21.670 --> 00:02:24.790
Patients with low stamina should have it with sweetened porridge.

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:36.000
Mommy, here's your medicine.

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:40.950
Everyone, help is sure to arrive from Kiyou soon.

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:44.140
So until then, keep yourselves strong!

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:51.710
At first, people were clearly distrustful of Eigetsu, but now they rely on him.

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:52.750
Here.

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:57.360
Drink this. You'll feel better.

00:02:57.980 --> 00:03:00.300
It's somewhat bitter, but bear it.

00:03:03.590 --> 00:03:07.200
You don't need to gulp it down. Drink it sip by sip.

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:12.210
Why do you smile all the time?

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:13.220
Huh?

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:17.170
You haven't slept much since you arrived here.

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:20.910
I might look weak, but I'm actually quite tough.

00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:22.970
Being full of energy is my best quality!

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:24.550
I can't thank you enough...

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:27.470
You should rest now.

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:46.470
It's a promise.

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:51.290
Other than in times of sadness,
try to smile as much as possible.

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:53.290
Doushu-sama...

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:55.890
Onii-chan.

00:03:58.660 --> 00:03:59.290
Shuuran?

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:01.890
Will help really come?

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:06.180
Will my mom and grandma really be saved?

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:08.810
They'll be fine.

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:11.560
A lady will arrive with doctors in no time at all.

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:13.310
They'll be saved for sure.

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:14.700
A lady?

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:18.690
Is the disease that lady's fault?

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:20.820
No, it's not!

00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:23.170
This disease isn't anyone's fault!

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:26.570
The lady who's coming here will definitely save us!

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:28.250
Really?

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:29.550
Yes.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:56.800
It can't be...

00:04:58.750 --> 00:04:59.600
Doushu-sama!

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:01.370
Onii-chan?

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:09.320
Wait!

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:11.340
Onii-chan!

00:05:14.820 --> 00:05:15.410
Sorry.

00:05:16.220 --> 00:05:19.110
Will you tell the others that I'll be gone for a while?

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:35.920
About ten years ago, when Eigetsu had just turned four years old...

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:52.650
his parents, who were poor, nearly killed him, so he ran away.

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:07.790
How terrible...

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:23.230
I'm sorry. There's nothing I can do. I'm sorry...

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:24.530
I'm sorry.

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:31.570
I wonder why you were born.

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:36.730
Humans are such idiotic creatures.

00:06:38.730 --> 00:06:41.940
Just worthless... absolutely worthless!

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:49.880
Well, perhaps it's fun because it's so ridiculous.

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:53.900
Should I take a physical body for once?

00:06:58.730 --> 00:06:59.730
Do you want to live?

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:06.090
I want to live.... much much more...

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:12.400
Fine, I'll let you live.

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:16.340
But, only for another 20 years or so.

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:20.300
You've died once, after all.

00:07:21.310 --> 00:07:24.280
I want to live... to be alive...

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:33.110
Just by living with me, your lifespan will diminish.

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:37.440
Show me how you'll live your life.

00:07:40.030 --> 00:07:40.560
You got that?

00:07:41.240 --> 00:07:41.940
Getsu...

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:48.940
No, you're my shadow, so you're "Eigetsu," and I'll call myself "Yougetsu."

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:19.540
Huh? Do you know who I am?

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:22.810
I'm not your sweet little Eigetsu.

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:24.590
Yes, I know.

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:28.310
You must be Yougetsu, the one who saved Eigetsu.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:31.220
A-Aren't you surprised?

00:08:31.890 --> 00:08:34.530
I heard the story from Eigetsu.

00:08:35.230 --> 00:08:38.000
Seriously, how big an idiot are you?

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:40.800
He died once and came back to life.

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:43.960
Do you really understand about Eigetsu and Yougetsu?

00:08:44.230 --> 00:08:46.440
Yes. I was overwhelmed back then.

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.960
You let him live, right?

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:56.230
The more often I appear, the shorter Eigetsu's life will be.

00:08:57.110 --> 00:08:59.010
Yes, apparently so.

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:02.770
If you hadn't appeared, I would never have met Eigetsu.

00:09:03.460 --> 00:09:05.390
Thank you, Yougetsu.

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:09.400
This isn't getting us anywhere. You're the biggest fool.

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:18.530
Eigetsu, did you collect a lot?

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:21.490
I've come out again!

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:24.080
Hello, Yougetsu.

00:09:24.690 --> 00:09:26.870
This isn't the time for you to be smiling!

00:09:27.270 --> 00:09:29.790
Each time I come out, I kill Eigetsu a little more!

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:34.760
To me, both you and Eigetsu are my adorable children.

00:09:38.030 --> 00:09:40.170
Who did you say was your child, you idiot?!

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:43.410
Do you realize I've lived much longer than you?

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:45.020
Hey, Yougetsu...

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:50.130
Eigetsu may be young, but he understands the decision he has made.

00:09:50.990 --> 00:09:53.580
How long you live is not important.

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:56.510
Just be happy until the moment your life ends.

00:09:57.720 --> 00:09:59.000
Do you understand that?

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:00.980
It's something you've given to us.

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:05.130
Eigetsu's happiness and my happiness today.

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:10.830
I-If that's so, show it to me.

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:14.550
I'll watch how Eigetsu uses his life until the end.

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:16.560
I'll give him time.

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:20.180
I'll only appear when Eigetsu drinks alcohol.

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:21.500
I see.

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:27.200
Don't forget this: Eigetsu's life is in my hands!

00:10:29.070 --> 00:10:30.440
Thank you, Yougetsu.

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:34.280
I'll live my life the best I can.

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:40.400
I'll live for everyone's happiness, and for me and Doushu-sama to be happy.

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:52.240
Everyone's... gone...

00:10:54.060 --> 00:10:56.170
Everyone in the village...

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:04.510
Doushu-sama? Doushu-sama?!

00:11:10.710 --> 00:11:12.770
Yougetsu has helped me again.

00:11:15.780 --> 00:11:19.580
He gave half of my life to Doushu-sama.

00:11:22.530 --> 00:11:25.650
But... that life had already...

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:29.640
Doushu-sama...

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:46.890
I'm... still alive...

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:50.480
This is...

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:58.740
I was chasing a man in white who looked like Doushu-sama.

00:12:05.290 --> 00:12:07.020
This place seems to be a mine shaft.

00:12:08.170 --> 00:12:09.470
This is where Jyasen-kyou is...

00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:43.360
Doushu-sama!

00:12:47.330 --> 00:12:49.080
So you've finally woken up!

00:12:52.600 --> 00:12:55.790
You're not Doushu-sama!

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:16.400
I can't stand the men's egos anymore!

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:19.030
Enough of all this self-satisfaction!

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:24.280
Eigetsu-sama, you better stay safe until I arrive, or else I won't forgive you!

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:26.990
Officer Rou!

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:27.850
What is it?

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:31.360
A letter with the hawk stamp arrived from Kiyou. It's from Governor Kou.

00:13:31.820 --> 00:13:35.410
A hawk stamp? Way to go, Princess! Awesome!

00:13:39.030 --> 00:13:41.170
Great! Hey, Saishou!

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:42.380
I'm going out!

00:13:44.770 --> 00:13:46.890
Please wait a minute! I'm coming too!

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:06.440
Now I see.

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:10.950
If only I'd realized this sooner!

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:17.830
It's this direction. I'm on my way, Eigetsu!

00:14:27.140 --> 00:14:28.030
Onii-chan...

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:38.580
Onii-chan...

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:44.830
You're not coming back.

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:47.210
You won't be coming back, will you, Onii-chan?

00:14:47.680 --> 00:14:49.660
Shuuran, you'll freeze yourself to death.

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:53.480
Just give up.

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:56.910
I know, Riou. I've already given up.

00:14:58.220 --> 00:15:01.550
He saw that it was incurable and just ran away, that guy.

00:15:01.550 --> 00:15:02.090
Stop it!

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:06.090
Eigetsu-onii-chan wouldn't do that!

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:08.010
But...

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:10.380
"Just for a while," he said.

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:13.020
Eigetsu-onii-chan doesn't lie.

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:15.250
Something happened to him.

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:17.980
Well, that's that.

00:15:20.260 --> 00:15:23.810
But it feels like we're back to square one.

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:25.520
Everyone looks sad.

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:35.480
He said a lady would be coming here to save us, but maybe everyone will be...

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:37.810
We can't just wait here.

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:40.920
We can't just sit and wait forever!

00:15:41.360 --> 00:15:45.420
If help is coming to us, we should go and find it!

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:48.220
That way we can meet the doctors sooner!

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:49.800
Are you serious?

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:52.240
We haven't done anything yet.

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:55.800
Eigetsu-onii-chan came from far away,

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:59.060
but we were just crying, shouting, and praying.

00:16:00.260 --> 00:16:01.900
This concerns our family.

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:04.560
We should do something about it ourselves!

00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:09.780
Are you saying we should carry sick people down the mountain in this weather?

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:12.190
It must be possible!

00:16:12.670 --> 00:16:14.300
We have a few carriages.

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:15.710
There's some spare medicine.

00:16:16.360 --> 00:16:17.260
It's now or never.

00:16:17.900 --> 00:16:19.540
Let's tell the others and get moving!

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:22.160
We don't have time to wait anymore!

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:29.560
Fine! Even if no one else comes, I'll carry my mom and go!

00:16:35.960 --> 00:16:36.810
Just hold on.

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:46.900
Um, are you all right, Shuurei-dono?

00:16:47.370 --> 00:16:48.650
You aren't unconscious, are you?

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:52.520
Well, I'd rather you were unconscious.

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:00.810
Rin-san is amazing...

00:17:06.980 --> 00:17:11.390
It took a month last time, but only eight days this time.

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:16.330
Thank you for responding to my
unreasonable request, Ran-shogun.

00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:23.450
It was Shuurei-dono who asked if I wanted to go for a mid-winter training ride to the provincial borders.

00:17:24.110 --> 00:17:25.690
It was just training, just training.

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:27.610
With extra weight...

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:30.910
Seriously, you'll be a bigwig one day.

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:35.650
Well, it won't be as simple from here on.

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:40.160
Yes, I got that feeling on the way here.

00:17:41.920 --> 00:17:46.800
Who'd have thought that the rumor Jyasen-kyou is spreading would've reached this far?

00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:52.180
The new female governor is to blame for the strange illness,

00:17:52.810 --> 00:17:56.340
and unless I'm offered as a sacrifice,
apparently the matter won't be settled.

00:17:57.440 --> 00:17:58.050
Ridiculous...

00:17:58.780 --> 00:18:03.260
All the more reason I must go there to deny the rumor!

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:16.450
Impassable?

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:18.060
What?

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:20.580
Where's the flag of the Imperial Army?

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:22.100
It's on display! They must've seen it!

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:34.150
Ran-shogun, you don't have to escort me from here on.

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:36.300
Thank you very much for your help.

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:38.080
Don't be stupid!

00:18:39.530 --> 00:18:42.890
People of Sairi Fortress! Are you all blind?!

00:18:43.210 --> 00:18:45.920
You must have received the order! Open the gate immediately!

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:47.600
W-We can't!

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:51.190
Why does Sashuu always get the worst of it?!

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:53.670
If you wanna get in, behead that woman!

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:01.020
Shogun!

00:19:02.930 --> 00:19:04.320
May I shoot them?

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:09.080
I'm very confident that I can take down every one of them.

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:17.670
I'd like to permit that right now, but it's a waste of arrows. Don't bother.

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:18.830
Yes, sir.

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:21.150
Well, what should we do?

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:25.470
You lot! What on earth are you fools thinking?!

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:27.820
Ouch!

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:42.860
Ensei!

00:19:43.610 --> 00:19:45.160
Ensei! Ensei!

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:48.980
It can't be anyone but Ensei!

00:19:49.530 --> 00:19:53.020
Well, this sure is a passionate welcome, Princess!

00:19:53.730 --> 00:19:55.290
Saishou, open it up!

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:04.680
Well, that was a fast trip.

00:20:05.020 --> 00:20:05.840
Saishou-san!

00:20:11.430 --> 00:20:14.860
Seiran told me to give this to you.

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:21.350
Huh? This is the sword he got from the Emperor!

00:20:21.770 --> 00:20:23.210
Yes. It's Kanshou.

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:25.720
What was he thinking?

00:20:26.650 --> 00:20:28.360
I can't use swords.

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:30.450
He should know that too...

00:20:39.190 --> 00:20:40.510
It doesn't feel right, does it?

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:45.650
The others are going to the most dangerous place, yet...

00:20:46.250 --> 00:20:47.030
True...

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:55.130
But I sort of understand how Governor Kou felt when she refused to send the Imperial Army.

00:20:56.620 --> 00:21:01.880
Refusing the escort of the Imperial Army meant that she stood against the Emperor's decision,

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:05.650
in order to protect Ran-shogun and the others.

00:21:06.560 --> 00:21:08.150
To make the point that our lives aren't that unimportant.

00:21:09.820 --> 00:21:11.190
Government officials are amazing.

00:21:11.690 --> 00:21:15.210
Depending on their decisions, they can protect their people like this.

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:24.110
Bring the medicine over here.

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:25.710
Place the food at the back.

00:21:25.710 --> 00:21:26.260
Yes, sir!

00:21:27.380 --> 00:21:28.680
What are you going to do with that?

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:31.970
Well, it's really a bother, but it can't be helped.

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:35.100
It's here instead of Seiran.

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:38.980
He entrusted this sword to me instead of coming himself.

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:39.580
What?

00:21:41.460 --> 00:21:43.230
Apparently he's grown up a bit.

00:21:43.820 --> 00:21:48.510
If he forced you to bring him along, I was going to beat him up.

00:21:51.520 --> 00:21:53.110
Hey, Princess...

00:21:53.690 --> 00:21:54.210
What is it?

00:21:57.510 --> 00:22:00.750
Have you ever seen people die one after another?

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:03.220
I reckon the situation is bad.

00:22:04.080 --> 00:22:05.360
Are you prepared for that?

00:22:06.980 --> 00:22:09.600
You're as relentless as ever, Ensei.

00:22:11.070 --> 00:22:11.740
It's all right.

00:22:12.250 --> 00:22:16.390
When the royal family was fighting over the succession, Kiyou was in a serious state as well.

00:22:17.070 --> 00:22:19.760
Besides, this time we have doctors and medicine.

00:22:20.290 --> 00:22:22.150
What should I be prepared for?

00:22:23.170 --> 00:22:28.810
Very well. I'll protect you no matter what, in place of Seiran.

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:30.780
It's a promise.

00:22:31.160 --> 00:22:34.370
What's going on? You're acting a bit cool, Ensei.

00:22:37.310 --> 00:22:37.750
By the way...

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:43.380
I have a favor to ask you before we go to Koringun.

00:22:46.290 --> 00:22:49.160
You know, Ensei, about the rumor...

00:22:50.330 --> 00:22:52.870
Perhaps it really is my fault.

00:22:55.460 --> 00:22:56.560
No way.

00:22:57.390 --> 00:22:58.060
But...

00:23:00.060 --> 00:23:01.560
The name of the founder is...

00:23:02.740 --> 00:23:04.230
Senya...

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:09.210
I can't be sure it has absolutely nothing to do with me.

00:23:12.570 --> 00:23:13.100
So...

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:14.830
Please, Ensei.

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:19.070
If my head is what's needed...

00:23:20.510 --> 00:23:22.170
then behead me without hesitation.

00:24:45.380 --> 00:24:47.540
Ensei, let's go to Korin Castle!

00:24:48.100 --> 00:24:50.170
There are numerous people suffering from the disease.

00:24:50.170 --> 00:24:55.090
Even if they throw stones at me or insult me, I'll go and save people.

00:24:55.390 --> 00:24:57.220
I'm counting on you, Ensei!
